msgid ""
"| MoE mode | Tensor parallel (AllGather) | Expert parallel (All-to-All) |"
msgstr "| MoE 模式 | 张量并行（AllGather） | 专家并行（All-to-All） |"

msgid "| Non-quantized | Supported | Supported |"
msgstr "| 非量化 | 支持 | 支持 |"

msgid "| W8A8 dynamic quantization | Supported | Supported |"
msgstr "| W8A8 动态量化 | 支持 | 支持 |"

msgid ""
"Other MoE quantization methods, Fused MC2, and dynamic EPLB are not "
"supported with LoRA."
msgstr "其他 MoE 量化方法、Fused MC2 和动态 EPLB 不支持与 LoRA 一起使用。"

msgid "# LoRA Adapters"
msgstr "# LoRA 适配器"

msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 功能简介"

msgid ""
"LoRA serves a frozen base model together with low-rank adapters. The client "
"selects an adapter by setting `model` to the `name` registered in `--lora-"
"modules`. The base weights stay loaded."
msgstr ""
"LoRA 在服务时使用冻结的基础模型以及低秩适配器。客户端通过将 `model` 设置为在 `--lora-modules` 中注册的 `name` "
"来选择适配器。基础权重始终保持加载状态。"

msgid ""
"Argument semantics and adapter file layout follow the [vLLM LoRA "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/). In the launch "
"command, `...` stands for the other flags of that deployment."
msgstr ""
"参数语义和适配器文件布局遵循 [vLLM LoRA "
"指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)。在启动命令中，`...` 代表该部署的其他标志。"

msgid "## Supported Hardware"
msgstr "## 支持的硬件"

msgid ""
"LoRA on vLLM-Ascend is supported on Atlas 300I Duo, Atlas A2, and Atlas A3."
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 上的 LoRA 支持 Atlas 300I Duo、Atlas A2 和 Atlas A3。"

msgid ""
"LoRA applies to both dense models and mixture-of-experts (MoE) models. The "
"base model stays frozen. Each request selects an adapter by the `name` "
"registered at startup. The current MoE support status is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"LoRA 适用于稠密模型和混合专家（MoE）模型。基础模型保持冻结。每个请求通过启动时注册的 `name` 选择适配器。当前 MoE 支持状态如下："

msgid "## LoRA Parameters"
msgstr "## LoRA 参数"

msgid "| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 默认值 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-lora` | flag | off | Enables LoRA and loads the adapters given "
"by `--lora-modules`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-lora` | flag | off | 启用 LoRA 并加载由 `--lora-modules` 指定的适配器。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--lora-modules` | JSON | none | Registers an adapter. Fields are `name`, "
"`path`, and `base_model_name`. A MoE adapter may also set "
"`is_3d_lora_weight`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--lora-modules` | JSON | none | 注册一个适配器。字段包括 `name`、`path` 和 "
"`base_model_name`。MoE 适配器还可以设置 `is_3d_lora_weight`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-loras` | int | 1 | Maximum number of adapters active in one batch. "
"|"
msgstr "| `--max-loras` | int | 1 | 一个批次中激活的适配器最大数量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-lora-rank` | int | 16 | Upper bound on the adapter rank `r`. Must "
"be one of 8, 16, 32, 64, and must be greater than or equal to `r`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-lora-rank` | int | 16 | 适配器秩 `r` 的上界。必须是 8、16、32、64 之一，并且必须大于或等于 "
"`r`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--fully-sharded-loras` | flag | off | Shards the full LoRA computation "
"across tensor-parallel ranks. By default only part of that computation is "
"sharded. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--fully-sharded-loras` | flag | off | 将完整的 LoRA 计算分片到张量并行 rank "
"上。默认情况下仅对该计算的一部分进行分片。 |"

msgid "### `--enable-lora`"
msgstr "### `--enable-lora`"

msgid ""
"`--enable-lora` turns LoRA serving on. Adapters listed in `--lora-modules` "
"are loaded only when this flag is set. Runtime load and unload also require "
"it."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-lora` 开启 LoRA 服务。只有在设置此标志时，才会加载 `--lora-modules` "
"中列出的适配器。运行时加载和卸载也需要它。"

msgid "### `--lora-modules`"
msgstr "### `--lora-modules`"

msgid ""
"`name` is the value the client sends as `model`. `path` is the PEFT adapter "
"directory, which contains `adapter_config.json` and the weight file. "
"`base_model_name` records the base checkpoint the adapter was trained on. "
"The client does not send `base_model_name`."
msgstr ""
"`name` 是客户端作为 `model` 发送的值。`path` 是 PEFT 适配器目录，其中包含 `adapter_config.json` "
"和权重文件。`base_model_name` 记录适配器训练所基于的基础检查点。客户端不发送 `base_model_name`。"

msgid ""
"For a fused PEFT MoE adapter, set `is_3d_lora_weight` to `true`. The expert "
"LoRA weights are then one stacked tensor, such as `experts.gate_up_proj` and"
" `experts.down_proj`. Per-expert keys use `false`. Non-MoE models ignore "
"this field. Layout rules are in the upstream [LoRA "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)."
msgstr ""
"对于融合的 PEFT MoE 适配器，将 `is_3d_lora_weight` 设置为 `true`。此时专家 LoRA 权重是一个堆叠张量，例如 "
"`experts.gate_up_proj` 和 `experts.down_proj`。按专家划分的键使用 `false`。非 MoE "
"模型忽略此字段。布局规则参见上游 [LoRA 指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/lora/)。"

msgid "### `--max-loras` and `--max-lora-rank`"
msgstr "### `--max-loras` 和 `--max-lora-rank`"

msgid ""
"`--max-lora-rank` must be one of 8, 16, 32, or 64, and it must be at least "
"the rank `r` in `adapter_config.json`. `--max-loras 1` keeps a single device"
" slot. That is the setting used by the fast path in the next section."
msgstr ""
"`--max-lora-rank` 必须是 8、16、32 或 64 之一，并且必须至少为 `adapter_config.json` 中的秩 "
"`r`。`--max-loras 1` 保留单个设备槽位。这是下一节中快速路径所使用的设置。"

msgid "### `--fully-sharded-loras`"
msgstr "### `--fully-sharded-loras`"

msgid ""
"Without this flag, tensor parallelism shards only part of the LoRA "
"computation. `--fully-sharded-loras` shards the rest as well. Use it when "
"the sequence is long, the rank is high, or the tensor-parallel size is "
"large. It does not change the request `model` name. The checked launches in "
"this page leave it off."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用此标志，张量并行仅对 LoRA 计算的一部分进行分片。`--fully-sharded-loras` "
"也会对其余部分进行分片。当序列较长、秩较高或张量并行规模较大时使用它。它不会改变请求的 `model` 名称。本页中已验证的启动命令均未启用它。"

msgid "## Performance"
msgstr "## 性能"

msgid ""
"**Single-slot fast path.** On Atlas A2 and Atlas A3, `--max-loras 1`, "
"`--fully-sharded-loras` left off, BF16 weights, a rank in {8, 16, 32, 64}, "
"and at most 128 tokens select two kernels. Shrink splits the long input "
"dimension (split-K) so more compute units work on a small token count. "
"Expand is fused: it reduces those partials, applies the adapter mask and "
"scale, multiplies by B, and adds the delta into the base output in one "
"launch. More than one active adapter, `--fully-sharded-loras`, or a rank "
"outside that set stays on the general SGMV/BGMV path."
msgstr ""
"**单槽位快速路径。** 在 Atlas A2 和 Atlas A3 上，`--max-loras 1`、未启用 `--fully-sharded-"
"loras`、BF16 权重、秩在 {8, 16, 32, 64} 中，且最多 128 个 token 时，会选择两个 kernel。Shrink "
"拆分较长的输入维度（split-K），使更多计算单元在少量 token 上工作。Expand "
"是融合的：它在一次启动中归约这些部分结果、应用适配器掩码和缩放、乘以 B，并将增量加到基础输出中。多于一个激活的适配器、启用 `--fully-"
"sharded-loras`，或秩不在该集合中时，将保持在通用 SGMV/BGMV 路径上。"

msgid ""
"**Fully sharded LoRA.** Add `--fully-sharded-loras` when partial sharding is"
" the limiter. This path does not use the fused single-slot kernels above."
msgstr ""
"**完全分片 LoRA。** 当部分分片成为限制因素时，添加 `--fully-sharded-loras`。此路径不使用上述融合的单槽位 "
"kernel。"

msgid "## Usage Example"
msgstr "## 使用示例"

msgid "### Qwen3.5-27B"
msgstr "### Qwen3.5-27B"

msgid ""
"To use the fully sharded path, add `--fully-sharded-loras` on the same "
"command."
msgstr "要使用完全分片路径，请在同一命令中添加 `--fully-sharded-loras`。"

msgid "### Request"
msgstr "### 请求"

msgid ""
"The two calls differ only in `model`. A base request uses the served model "
"name and runs the frozen base weights only. A LoRA request uses the `name` "
"from `--lora-modules` and adds that adapter on top of the same base. "
"`base_model_name` inside `--lora-modules` is not a request name."
msgstr ""
"这两个调用仅在 `model` 上有所不同。基础请求使用服务模型名称，仅运行冻结的基础权重。LoRA 请求使用 `--lora-modules` 中的 "
"`name`，并在同一基础之上添加该适配器。`--lora-modules` 中的 `base_model_name` 不是请求名称。"

msgid "Base:"
msgstr "基础："

msgid "LoRA:"
msgstr "LoRA："

msgid ""
"`Qwen3.5-27B` is the served base name from this example. If the launch sets "
"`--served-model-name`, use that string instead. A successful call returns "
"HTTP 200 and a non-empty `choices[0].message.content`."
msgstr ""
"`Qwen3.5-27B` 是本示例中服务的基础名称。如果启动时设置了 `--served-model-name`，请改用该字符串。成功的调用返回 "
"HTTP 200 和非空的 `choices[0].message.content`。"

msgid "## Dynamic LoRA"
msgstr "## 动态 LoRA"

msgid ""
"The server can load and unload adapters after startup. Start it with "
"`--enable-lora`, and set:"
msgstr "服务器可以在启动后加载和卸载适配器。使用 `--enable-lora` 启动它，并设置："

msgid ""
"Load an adapter. `lora_name` is the `model` value used by later requests. "
"`lora_path` is the adapter directory."
msgstr "加载一个适配器。`lora_name` 是后续请求使用的 `model` 值。`lora_path` 是适配器目录。"

msgid "Unload that adapter:"
msgstr "卸载该适配器："

msgid ""
"A successful load returns `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' added "
"successfully.` A successful unload returns `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora'"
" removed successfully.` After unload, requests with `\"model\": \"mix-"
"lora\"` no longer select that adapter. The base model remains available."
msgstr ""
"成功加载返回 `Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' added successfully.` 成功卸载返回 "
"`Success: LoRA adapter 'mix-lora' removed successfully.` 卸载后，带有 `\"model\": "
"\"mix-lora\"` 的请求不再选择该适配器。基础模型仍然可用。"
